				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">(1) The amounts set forth in rows 7, 9 and 11 above include 355,218 shares of common stock, par value $0.0001 per share ("Common Stock") of Rocket Lab USA, Inc., a Delaware corporation (the "Company"), which Peter Beck has the right to acquire through settlement of restricted stock units within 60 days of January 7, 2025.
